          "date": "2026-06-08 13:12:33.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-19917 mgc: dynamic MGS nids discovery",
        "message": "LU-19917 mgc: dynamic MGS nids discovery\n\n. enable fault tolerant MGS, client can connect to any server as MGS\n. MGS nid list can be specified in client mount command, and they\n  will be shuffled to balance load, the benefit of MGS nid list is\n  that the system startup time is reduced for large clusters, and the\n  MGS load is balanced among all servers.\n. imperative recovery log process adds all server nids to client\n  MGC import dynamically, so that user can start using fault tolerant\n  MGS without any configuration.\n. client MGC name should be different from server MGC, because server\n  MGC only connects to primary MGS, rename it to \"MGCCL+nid\".\n\nSigned-off-by: Lai Siyao <lai.siyao@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ib6d2b1ff6bce8d1a51a54982356c859448cf7f05\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
